    comment "en" """
        Source V7200 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V72.0 SNOMED CT 214640008, with activity. Activity
        suffix has no SNOMED CT analogue. Athena V72.0 crosswalk (concept 45756003) Maps to SNOMED CT 437738
